# Secrets — NEVER commit these.
.env
.env.local
*.env

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Results may contain model output; local by default.
#
# EXCEPT the combined reports, which are committed: they are the evidence for
# every number the cohort tables and charts print, and a chart whose source
# reports are absent cannot be audited. They are ~4 KB each. The per-eval and
# per-board reports stay ignored, since they carry 450 boardResults and the
# raw model response per model, and nothing published cites them directly.
results/*
!results/combined-*.json
prompts.txt

# OS
.DS_Store

# Editor settings are per-machine. The suite deliberately has no build step or
# project config to share, and extension recommendations are a matter of taste.
.vscode/
.idea/

# Backgrounded run logs
nohup.out
*.log

# Private scratch notes: model cohorts, scoring experiments, todo lists.
notes.md

# Local planning docs, not part of the published suite.
monkey-do-v2-plan.md
